@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title Solicitud mantenida y la duración de comando de 2 s

binary "run_request" as R
binary "run (consolidado)" as S
binary "drive" as D

@0
R is low
S is low
D is low

@1
R is high
S is high
D is high

@3
D is low
note bottom of D : plazo alcanzado;\nla solicitud sigue en true

@5
R is low
S is low

@6
R is high
S is high
D is high

@8
D is low

D@1 <-> @3 : 2 s
D@6 <-> @8 : 2 s nuevos
@enduml
